{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-ac825da481f041d3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait, but this test would also pass without `cn` — it would just be `clsx('text-lg', { 'bg-red-500': true, 'font-bold': true })` returning `'text-lg bg-red-500 font-bold'`. That doesn't really test twMerge's merging behavior.\n\nLet me think about a better test. The whole point of `cn` is to use twMerge to merge Tailwind classes. A proper test would show that:\n- Using clsx alone would give duplicate/conflicting classes\n- Using twMerge via cn deduplicates them\n\n\n- I could test that a conflicting class gets resolved by twMerge while keeping the non-conflicting ones intact\n","signature":"ee98426362ce4eda931dba04d0071c12"}],"model":"qwen3.6-35b","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":199375,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8fb51005-a686-498d-8403-19206d765de7","uuid":"f72b25f9-e503-49c0-b746-dcfcbab96804","timestamp":"2026-08-04T06:54:42.308Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-ac825da481f041d3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"chatcmpl-tool-a2c8c654634553d5","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/surindersingh/ralph-workspaces/c9072b42-b87d-41f9-9f84-52cd1a37673c/dc5ea6e0-6839-4a4b-bc1c-d7416cac73af/src/lib/utils.test.ts","old_string":"  it('merges object classes with string classes', () => {\n    // twMerge merges: bg-red-500 preserved alongside text-lg, font-bold applied\n    expect(cn('text-lg', { 'bg-red-500': true, 'font-bold': true })).toBe('text-lg bg-red-500 font-bold')\n  })","new_string":"  it('merges object classes with string classes', () => {\n    // twMerge: p-4 overrides p-2, bg-red-500 is non-conflicting so preserved\n    expect(cn('p-2', { 'p-4': true, 'bg-red-500': true })).toBe('p-4 bg-red-500')\n  })"}}],"model":"qwen3.6-35b","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":199375,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8fb51005-a686-498d-8403-19206d765de7","uuid":"c515fcaa-f9c0-4a75-b171-1a138271dab9","timestamp":"2026-08-04T06:55:05.559Z"}
